{{also|над}}
==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|надо-}} {{qualifier|used before certain consonant clusters}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|над-|ann=y}} {{i|before vowels and voiced consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|нат-|ann=над-}} {{i|before voiceless consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|на́д-|ann=y}} {{i|when stressed and voiced consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|на́т-|ann=над-}} {{i|when stressed, before voiceless consonants}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|head=над-|head2=на́д-|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# {{n-g|takes verbs, produces verbs}}: to [[extend]], [[add]]
# {{n-g|takes verbs, produces verbs}}: to [[apply]] an action or measure
#: {{prefex|ru|над-|-зира́ть|t2=to [[look]] at|надзира́ть|t3=to oversee}}
# {{n-g|takes verbs, produces verbs}}: to [[apply]] an action in incomplete manner
#: {{prefex|ru|над-|куси́ть|t2=to [[bite]]|надкуси́ть|t3=to take a bite, nibble}}
# {{n-g|takes verbs, produces verbs}}: [[super-]]
#: {{prefex|ru|над-|писа́ть|t2=to [[write]]|надписа́ть|t3=to [[superscribe]], to [[inscribe]]}}
# {{n-g|takes nouns, produces nouns and adjectives}}: [[over]], [[above]]
#: {{prefex|ru|над-|вода́|t2=[[water]]|-ный|pos3=adjective-forming suffix|надво́дный|t4=[[above-water]]}}
#: {{prefex|ru|над-|гроб|t2=[[grave]]|q2=poetic|-ие|pos3=noun-forming suffix|надгро́бие|t4=[[tombstone]]|lit4=thing '''over''' the grave}}

====Usage notes====
* The suffix is found stressed in some noun derivations, e.g. {{m|ru|на́дпись||[[inscription]]}} (from {{m|ru|надписа́ть||to [[caption]], to [[inscribe]]; to [[write]] [[above]]}}).

